      'United by a shared vision and occasionally conflicting personal interests, our management combines political expertise, entrepreneurial instinct and an unwavering commitment to making decisions others would hesitate to consider.',
      'Together, they lead The Bolos Universal Company™ toward its ultimate ambition: the Hostile Takeover of Absurdity.',
    ],
  },
  {
